- services/auth_service.py: extract login logic from ui/login_window.py
  into a UI-independent authenticate(username, password) function.
  Same error messages/behavior as before, plus additive LastLogin update.
- services/web_session_service.py: cookie-based web session login on a
  dedicated WebSessions table, fully independent of the desktop
  services/session_service.py (Phase 12 heartbeat/crash recovery).
- database/migrations/015_web_sessions.sql: additive WebSessions table.
- ui/login_window.py: now delegates to auth_service (no user-visible
  behavior change).
- web/app.py: add GET/POST /login, POST /logout, protect "/";
  /health stays unauthenticated per Phase 16B decision.
- web/templates/login.html (new), home.html/style.css updated for
  logged-in user + logout button.
- requirements-web.txt: add python-multipart (required by FastAPI Form
  parsing for POST /login).
- tests: test_auth_service.py (8), test_web_session_service.py (8),
  test_web_auth.py (11) — full suite: 244 passed (217 previous + 27 new,
  zero regressions).
- Docs: AI_HANDOFF.md, PHASE_REGISTRY.md, database/README.md updated.
